+raised. Rules are compared based on their path, subdomain or host, websocket
+mode, and methods. Rules whose methods do not overlap are not duplicates. A rule
+without ``methods`` matches all methods, so it duplicates any rule with the same
+path. Variable parts are not equal if they use different converters, although
